<title>DUBAI: UAE 1995 balance of payment surplus 2.78 bln dhs.</title>
<headline>UAE 1995 balance of payment surplus 2.78 bln dhs.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United Arab Emirates balance of payments surplus rose to 2.78 billion dirhams in 1995 from 2.36 billion in 1994, central bank figures show.</p>
<p>					 1995			1994</p>
<p> Balance of payments	    +2.78		     +2.36</p>
<p> Capital account		 -10.99		     -8.79</p>
<p> Current account		 +13.77		    +11.15</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are in billions of dirhams. The 1995 figures are preliminary. The 1994 figures are revised.</p>
<p>-- Dubai Newsroom, 9714-626990</p>
</text>
